{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Who is the simple one</b> — the simple one is one in whom deficiency is fully fixed, yet there is hope for his correction." "<b>And said, Turn in here</b> — that is, let him turn from his place and come here, [he who is] lacking sense; and she called to him, that is, and so she called and said to him who lacks sense."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:39.027934654Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}